%% Sequence 09d — Browse talent directory
%% Updated: 2026-07-27.
%% Scenario: organization owner/admin filters talent evidence.
%% Evidence status: Implemented.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor R as Organization owner / admin
    participant C as «boundary» OrgTalentsPageController
    participant O as «query» RecruitingDirectoryAccessQuery
    participant Q as «control» GetTalentDirectoryPageQuery
    participant D as «entity» PostgreSQL

    R->>C: GET /org/talents with filters
    activate C
    C->>O: canAccess(current organization, actor)
    O-->>C: Admin-shell access allowed or denied
    alt Authorized organization owner/admin
        C->>Q: handle(search, evidence filters, saved, pagination)
        activate Q
        Q->>D: Read evidence, match inputs and recruiter bookmarks
        D-->>Q: Ranked directory page and explainability signals
        Q-->>C: Talent directory result
        deactivate Q
        C-->>R: Render talents/index
    else Access denied
        C-->>R: Redirect to marketplace
    end
    deactivate C
